WEBVTT

1
01:05:09.570 --> 01:05:12.570
Hallelujah!

2
01:05:40.570 --> 01:05:51.570
And what I had this morning was a bit less prepared than usual, but the Word is not about that, for the Word is clear and straightforward.

3
01:05:51.570 --> 01:05:58.570
And I want to bring the piece for the heart of David for the temple building.

4
01:05:58.570 --> 01:06:03.570
For the heart of David was, I want to build that temple, I want to build a house for the Lord.

5
01:06:03.570 --> 01:06:07.570
And God, in all that history, it is precisely about that.

6
01:06:07.570 --> 01:06:10.570
You know what? I will build a temple for you.

7
01:06:10.570 --> 01:06:12.570
And I find it so beautiful that God says that.

8
01:06:12.570 --> 01:06:20.570
But the heart of David also clearly comes forward when it is time to sow for the temple.

9
01:06:20.570 --> 01:06:23.570
And he sows, he sows from his heart.

10
01:06:23.570 --> 01:06:28.570
And what does he do? He sows so much towards his son, for he was not allowed to build the temple himself.

11
01:06:28.570 --> 01:06:29.570
That was a different season.

12
01:06:29.570 --> 01:06:32.570
And God has His prescriptions for that and His thoughts about it.

13
01:06:32.570 --> 01:06:35.570
And His thoughts were also clearly expressed to David.

14
01:06:35.570 --> 01:06:37.570
But what he could do, he did.

15
01:06:37.570 --> 01:06:43.570
And he gathered, and converted that is about 20 billion euros.

16
01:06:43.570 --> 01:06:46.570
Then you say, well, that is quite a substantial amount.

17
01:06:46.570 --> 01:06:48.570
You could almost buy all of Lommel for that.

18
01:06:48.570 --> 01:06:52.570
But what it is about, that is not what it is about.

19
01:06:52.570 --> 01:07:00.570
And besides, what he also did, he says, Father it is not good if I contribute alone.

20
01:07:00.570 --> 01:07:01.570
That it must come only from me.

21
01:07:01.570 --> 01:07:05.570
And what does he do? He gathers the whole people there.

22
01:07:05.570 --> 01:07:08.570
First the leaders, and then also the whole people.

23
01:07:08.570 --> 01:07:10.570
And then even more is collected.

24
01:07:10.570 --> 01:07:15.570
And do you know what it is? This is what God wants to say.

25
01:07:15.570 --> 01:07:21.570
He wants the church that is being built, that it is his people who do it.

26
01:07:21.570 --> 01:07:27.570
That it is from his house, that his house builds the house.

27
01:07:27.570 --> 01:07:37.570
And if you commit yourself and plant yourself in the work of God's kingdom, then everything can belong to that.

28
01:07:37.570 --> 01:07:40.570
Then the boring can also belong to that.

29
01:07:40.570 --> 01:07:44.570
And the beautiful thing about that is the text I have for today.

30
01:07:44.570 --> 01:07:49.570
I don't know if it will be projected, but that is the prayer of King David in that transition.

31
01:07:49.570 --> 01:07:53.570
When they have all sown together, he goes to thank God.

32
01:07:53.570 --> 01:08:00.570
And then you see the heart of David, of why and how he gives.

33
01:08:00.570 --> 01:08:03.570
And I will just read it if it is projected, hallelujah.

34
01:08:03.570 --> 01:08:05.570
If not, still hallelujah.

35
01:08:05.570 --> 01:08:13.570
King David was also very happy with this, with what the people had collected as well.

36
01:08:13.570 --> 01:08:20.570
And he praised the Lord, and he said, I praise you Lord, God of our Father Israel, forever.

37
01:08:20.570 --> 01:08:23.570
For you are great and mighty.

38
01:08:23.570 --> 01:08:25.570
You are a mighty king.

39
01:08:25.570 --> 01:08:28.570
Everything in heaven and on earth is yours.

40
01:08:28.570 --> 01:08:30.570
You are the most high king.

41
01:08:30.570 --> 01:08:34.570
If someone is rich and powerful, then you have given it to him.

42
01:08:34.570 --> 01:08:36.570
For you reign over everything.

43
01:08:36.570 --> 01:08:37.570
You are all-powerful.

44
01:08:37.570 --> 01:08:39.570
You can make people great and powerful.

45
01:08:39.570 --> 01:08:43.570
And now we thank and praise you, our God.

46
01:08:43.570 --> 01:08:47.570
How could I and my people give you these wonderful gifts?

47
01:08:47.570 --> 01:08:49.570
For it is all already yours.

48
01:08:49.570 --> 01:08:53.570
We have received it from you and we give it back to you.

49
01:08:53.570 --> 01:08:54.570
That is so beautiful.

50
01:08:54.570 --> 01:08:58.570
We are but strangers before you, just like our ancestors.

51
01:08:58.570 --> 01:09:00.570
Our life is gone in a moment.

52
01:09:00.570 --> 01:09:02.570
We have nothing to expect.

53
01:09:02.570 --> 01:09:08.570
Lord God, all this wealth that we have gathered to build a temple for you is yours.

54
01:09:08.570 --> 01:09:10.570
Everything is yours.

55
01:09:10.570 --> 01:09:15.570
I know, my God, that you are pleased when someone loves you.

56
01:09:15.570 --> 01:09:18.570
And I have given you this because I love you.

57
01:09:19.570 --> 01:09:21.570
This is it.

58
01:09:22.570 --> 01:09:28.570
And I am glad to see that the others who are here have also given you gifts.

59
01:09:28.570 --> 01:09:36.570
Lord God of our ancestors Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, will you help us to always remain this way.

60
01:09:36.570 --> 01:09:40.570
To always love you so much.

61
01:09:40.570 --> 01:09:42.570
And also help my son.

62
01:09:42.570 --> 01:09:44.570
That is the next generation.

63
01:09:45.570 --> 01:09:48.570
Help my son to always love You.

64
01:09:48.570 --> 01:09:52.570
For then he will keep all Your laws and commandments.

65
01:09:52.570 --> 01:09:55.570
And then he will build the temple that I have designed.

66
01:09:55.570 --> 01:09:58.570
God is a God of generations.

67
01:09:58.570 --> 01:10:02.570
And what we are engaged in is something that God is doing.

68
01:10:02.570 --> 01:10:04.570
But He wants to use you and me.

69
01:10:04.570 --> 01:10:11.570
He also wants that little bit that we then have, to bring it back in the eyes of God.

70
01:10:11.570 --> 01:10:13.570
From all that we have already received from Him.

71
01:10:13.570 --> 01:10:16.570
And we may do that with joy.

72
01:10:16.570 --> 01:10:18.570
Why? Because we love Him.

73
01:10:18.570 --> 01:10:21.570
Perhaps it is nice to thank for that and to stand together for a moment.

74
01:10:21.570 --> 01:10:26.570
And bring back what God places in your heart to bring back.

75
01:10:26.570 --> 01:10:28.570
Father, thank You very much.

76
01:10:28.570 --> 01:10:31.570
Lord, You are the good good Father.

77
01:10:31.570 --> 01:10:33.570
Lord, You are in fatherhood.

78
01:10:33.570 --> 01:10:35.570
Lord, You are also our great provider.

79
01:10:35.570 --> 01:10:37.570
Lord, You have already given everything.

80
01:10:37.570 --> 01:10:39.570
Lord, according to what You want.

81
01:10:39.570 --> 01:10:40.570
Lord will be done.

82
01:10:40.570 --> 01:10:44.570
And your will, Lord, is that we build your kingdom together.

83
01:10:44.570 --> 01:10:47.570
Lord, how incompetent we often are.

84
01:10:47.570 --> 01:10:49.570
Lord, may we build your kingdom together.

85
01:10:49.570 --> 01:10:54.570
Lord, yes, it is a mystery.

86
01:10:54.570 --> 01:10:59.570
Lord, that you have chosen us, Lord, to be and to build your kingdom together.

87
01:10:59.570 --> 01:11:01.570
Lord, that your love is so great.

88
01:11:01.570 --> 01:11:06.570
Lord, and so we also pray, Lord, not only for this building project.

89
01:11:06.570 --> 01:11:10.570
But the collection for today is for the daily affairs.

90
01:11:10.570 --> 01:11:14.570
Lord, that is just as much your temple, Lord, as the building we are going to construct.

91
01:11:14.570 --> 01:11:15.570
Lord, actually even more.

92
01:11:15.570 --> 01:11:18.570
Lord, and we pray this out, Lord, over open church.

93
01:11:18.570 --> 01:11:20.570
Lord, that you will also let your oil flow.

94
01:11:20.570 --> 01:11:23.570
Lord, bring us back.

95
01:11:23.570 --> 01:11:27.570
Lord, for when we give you the first place, even in our wallet.

96
01:11:27.570 --> 01:11:29.570
Lord, then you will provide in everything.

97
01:11:29.570 --> 01:11:31.570
Lord, for you know exactly what we need.

98
01:11:31.570 --> 01:11:33.570
Lord, and I pray this out, Lord, for open church.

99
01:11:33.570 --> 01:11:35.570
Lord, that we will be known.

100
01:11:35.570 --> 01:11:39.570
Lord, for that which, Lord, we may also bring back.

101
01:11:39.570 --> 01:11:42.570
Lord, what we may reflect on, Lord, of your goodness.

102
01:11:42.570 --> 01:11:44.570
But also what we may bring back of your goodness.

103
01:11:44.570 --> 01:11:47.570
Lord, and we pray this in the name of King Jesus.

104
01:11:47.570 --> 01:11:51.570
And I pray that it will be a blessing and new fruit.

105
01:11:51.570 --> 01:11:55.570
And for new generations that will worship you.

106
01:11:55.570 --> 01:11:59.570
And will honor you and will praise and glorify you, Lord, in making your name great.

107
01:11:59.570 --> 01:12:03.570
And we pray, Lord, that you will show your goodness and your love.

108
01:12:03.570 --> 01:12:05.570
Lord, you will show it to your people.

109
01:12:05.570 --> 01:12:08.570
Lord, that your majesty will be shown here in the Kempen.

110
01:12:08.570 --> 01:12:11.570
Lord, for your majesty will be seen.

111
01:12:11.570 --> 01:12:14.570
Lord, and we pray for this, Lord, in the name of King Jesus.

112
01:12:14.570 --> 01:12:16.570
Lord, that it will be your work and remain so.

113
01:12:16.570 --> 01:12:20.570
And just like David Bart, that we will always hold this.

114
01:12:20.570 --> 01:12:22.570
Lord, that we will always maintain this attitude.

115
01:12:22.570 --> 01:12:25.570
Lord, as we may bring back to you in the name of Jesus.

116
01:12:25.570 --> 01:12:27.570
Amen.

117
01:12:28.570 --> 01:12:30.570
APPLAUSE

118
01:12:38.570 --> 01:12:40.570
Amen.

119
01:12:40.570 --> 01:12:42.570
Amen.

120
01:12:43.570 --> 01:12:46.570
Well, good morning.

121
01:12:46.570 --> 01:12:48.570
Good morning.

122
01:12:48.570 --> 01:12:51.570
No one eats so we will go until six.

123
01:12:53.570 --> 01:12:55.570
Amen.

124
01:12:55.570 --> 01:12:57.570
Okay, I will pray.

125
01:12:57.570 --> 01:12:59.570
Let us pray.

126
01:12:59.570 --> 01:13:00.570
No one is laughing.

127
01:13:00.570 --> 01:13:02.570
It is not funny.

128
01:13:02.570 --> 01:13:04.570
Eating is not funny.

129
01:13:04.570 --> 01:13:05.570
Food is not funny.

130
01:13:05.570 --> 01:13:07.570
Don't touch my food.

131
01:13:07.570 --> 01:13:08.570
Don't come near my food.

132
01:13:08.570 --> 01:13:09.570
That is why we fast.

133
01:13:09.570 --> 01:13:11.570
That is why we fast.

134
01:13:11.570 --> 01:13:13.570
Okay, thank you Lord.

135
01:13:13.570 --> 01:13:14.570
Thank you Lord.

136
01:13:14.570 --> 01:13:15.570
No one is funny.

137
01:13:15.570 --> 01:13:17.570
Okay, I am not funny.

138
01:13:17.570 --> 01:13:19.570
Thank you Lord, I am not funny.

139
01:13:19.570 --> 01:13:20.570
Thank you Lord.

140
01:13:20.570 --> 01:13:21.570
So we will read your Word.

141
01:13:21.570 --> 01:13:23.570
Thank you for your Word, Lord.

142
01:13:23.570 --> 01:13:25.570
Thank you for your Word, Lord.

143
01:13:28.570 --> 01:13:32.570
Thank you that you provide us with food through your Spirit.

144
01:13:35.570 --> 01:13:38.570
You give us what we truly need.

145
01:13:39.570 --> 01:13:42.570
And that is a revelation of who you are.

146
01:13:45.570 --> 01:13:48.570
And to walk in your will, in your way.

147
01:13:50.570 --> 01:13:52.570
So come and fill us.

148
01:13:53.570 --> 01:13:54.570
Come and fill the hungry.

149
01:13:56.570 --> 01:13:58.570
Come and fill those who are thirsty.

150
01:14:00.570 --> 01:14:01.570
Only you can do that.

151
01:14:01.570 --> 01:14:02.570
Amen.

152
01:14:04.570 --> 01:14:06.570
We are fasting.

153
01:14:10.570 --> 01:14:13.570
After the prayer evening tomorrow, we will break that fasting time together.

154
01:14:15.570 --> 01:14:17.570
If you have time to be there.

155
01:14:23.570 --> 01:14:33.570
And it is not too late to join in, so even if you step in at this moment, that is fine.

156
01:14:39.570 --> 01:14:41.570
Let’s turn together to Matthew 4.

157
01:14:48.570 --> 01:14:51.570
And I want to look at fasting and what it brings forth in us.

158
01:14:54.570 --> 01:14:55.570
Jesus fasted.

159
01:14:57.570 --> 01:14:58.570
For me, that is enough.

160
01:15:00.570 --> 01:15:02.570
For me, that is enough to convince me.

161
01:15:04.570 --> 01:15:06.570
People fast like that too.

162
01:15:11.570 --> 01:15:16.570
And he taught his disciples, those who followed him and learned from him, to do the same.

163
01:15:23.570 --> 01:15:32.570
And if you are open to following Jesus, there comes a moment in your life when he begins to speak to you about prayer.

164
01:15:34.570 --> 01:15:36.570
He talks to you about serving.

165
01:15:43.570 --> 01:15:49.570
And I'm not just talking about going to church on Sunday, but dedicating your life as a servant in the kingdom.

166
01:15:50.570 --> 01:15:52.570
He will speak to you about giving.

167
01:15:56.570 --> 01:15:57.570
For he did all those things.

168
01:15:59.570 --> 01:16:00.570
He did not live for himself.

169
01:16:07.570 --> 01:16:13.570
He lived for the will of the Father to be done in his life while he was on earth.

170
01:16:19.570 --> 01:16:23.570
So if you are born again, you are born again into that kingdom.

171
01:16:28.570 --> 01:16:30.570
And the kingdom is where you are.

172
01:16:32.570 --> 01:16:33.570
Yes, you are here on earth.

173
01:16:39.570 --> 01:16:42.570
But you step out of the earthly culture and you step into that kingdom.

174
01:16:43.570 --> 01:16:48.570
And there is a washing and a sanctification that takes place year in and year out.

175
01:16:54.570 --> 01:16:56.570
Until you no longer live in the pattern of that world.

176
01:17:01.570 --> 01:17:02.570
But you live a completely different lifestyle.

177
01:17:06.570 --> 01:17:07.570
And that is a special lifestyle.

178
01:17:13.570 --> 01:17:16.570
It is special for the earth. It is special for the world.

179
01:17:16.570 --> 01:17:21.570
You are a stranger to the world if you are born again into the kingdom.

180
01:17:21.570 --> 01:17:24.570
You look strange. You are not the same.

181
01:17:31.570 --> 01:17:41.570
For you no longer follow the crowd. The crowd goes one way.

182
01:17:43.570 --> 01:17:46.570
And Jesus says, there is a narrow way.

183
01:17:51.570 --> 01:17:54.570
Narrow. It is narrow. It is narrow.

184
01:17:57.570 --> 01:17:59.570
And He says, you will not find many people on that way.

185
01:18:04.570 --> 01:18:06.570
He says, few find that path.

186
01:18:07.570 --> 01:18:08.570
He says, few find that path.

187
01:18:10.570 --> 01:18:11.570
Few.

188
01:18:18.570 --> 01:18:21.570
He does not use exaggeration here. He means what he says.

189
01:18:24.570 --> 01:18:25.570
He spoke to the large crowd.

190
01:18:25.570 --> 01:18:32.570
But even among the crowds, He says, few find my path.

191
01:18:37.570 --> 01:18:44.570
That is why He always said, to those who have ears, let them hear.

192
01:18:50.570 --> 01:18:53.570
And He did not mean, have you heard what I say, but have you done what I say.

193
01:18:56.570 --> 01:18:58.570
Then your ears really work.

194
01:19:03.570 --> 01:19:06.570
And I want to look at a specific time that Jesus had.

195
01:19:09.570 --> 01:19:11.570
And I want to look at what comes from that.

196
01:19:13.570 --> 01:19:14.570
Matthew 4, verse 1.

197
01:19:19.570 --> 01:19:21.570
Then Jesus was led by the Spirit.

198
01:19:26.570 --> 01:19:29.570
Into the wilderness to be tempted by the devil.

199
01:19:36.570 --> 01:19:42.570
And after He had fasted for forty days and forty nights, He was hungry.

200
01:19:43.570 --> 01:19:44.570
Yes, that is clear.

201
01:19:46.570 --> 01:19:48.570
Don't you find it nice when the Bible is clear?

202
01:19:49.570 --> 01:19:50.570
Jesus was hungry.

203
01:19:56.570 --> 01:20:03.570
And when I read this years ago, I felt that the Lord said, He was not only physically hungry.

204
01:20:05.570 --> 01:20:06.570
He was hungry.

205
01:20:08.570 --> 01:20:09.570
He was hungry.

206
01:20:11.570 --> 01:20:12.570
He was spiritually hungry.

207
01:20:20.570 --> 01:20:22.570
He has a hunger for something.

208
01:20:25.570 --> 01:20:29.570
Jesus is not added because He fasted.

209
01:20:30.570 --> 01:20:36.570
We know from the verse before that when He is baptized, the Father says, this is my beloved.

210
01:20:37.570 --> 01:20:39.570
This is my Son in whom I am very pleased.

211
01:20:40.570 --> 01:20:47.570
And we know that even before He went fasting, He was baptized and the Father gave Him that confirmation.

212
01:20:48.570 --> 01:20:53.570
And from heaven spoke, this is my beloved. This is my Son in whom I have my pleasure.

213
01:20:59.570 --> 01:21:04.570
Before Jesus fasted for forty days and forty nights, the Father already affirmed Him and confirmed Him.

214
01:21:05.570 --> 01:21:11.570
So He is not fasting to earn that approval.

215
01:21:13.570 --> 01:21:14.570
And that applies to us too.

216
01:21:14.570 --> 01:21:17.570
I am not fasting because I think, God wants to love me if I fast. No, no, no.

217
01:21:18.570 --> 01:21:21.570
I am firm. I already have all His love. I already have all His application.

218
01:21:22.570 --> 01:21:24.570
I had that twenty years ago when I went under the water of baptism.

219
01:21:25.570 --> 01:21:27.570
That is what Jesus said. Under the water of baptism.

220
01:21:28.570 --> 01:21:32.570
I affirm you. You are in my Son. You have His righteousness.

221
01:21:39.570 --> 01:21:40.570
There is no question.

222
01:21:45.570 --> 01:21:46.570
But...

223
01:21:51.570 --> 01:21:59.570
Jesus always... The Father was always pleased with the choices Jesus made.

224
01:22:03.570 --> 01:22:05.570
Jesus lived in righteousness.

225
01:22:06.570 --> 01:22:08.570
And the Father was pleased with that.

226
01:22:08.570 --> 01:22:18.570
Every choice Jesus made here on earth, the Father was pleased with that.

227
01:22:24.570 --> 01:22:29.570
Every thought, every heart attitude, the Father was pleased with that.

228
01:22:38.570 --> 01:22:44.570
So when the Spirit leads Jesus in a time of forty days of fasting,

229
01:22:45.570 --> 01:22:48.570
He does not ask the question, would the Father still love me?

230
01:22:52.570 --> 01:22:55.570
He does that to fulfill the will of God.

231
01:22:58.570 --> 01:23:00.570
He does that to walk in the will of the Lord.

232
01:23:03.570 --> 01:23:06.570
He does that to fulfill that righteousness.

233
01:23:09.570 --> 01:23:13.570
He was on a 40-day fast, and then it says that He is hungry.

234
01:23:13.570 --> 01:23:20.570
It is not just a physical hunger. Jesus is hungry to fulfill the will of the Father.

235
01:23:28.570 --> 01:23:30.570
He is hungry to begin.

236
01:23:31.570 --> 01:23:33.570
It is only the beginning.

237
01:23:33.570 --> 01:23:43.570
After this time of fasting, He is as it were launched into His three-year ministry.

238
01:23:54.570 --> 01:23:58.570
The time Jesus spent in His twenties is hidden from us.

239
01:23:58.570 --> 01:24:00.570
We have no idea what happened then.

240
01:24:00.570 --> 01:24:02.570
Enjoy your hidden years.

241
01:24:04.570 --> 01:24:06.570
Enjoy your hidden years.

242
01:24:08.570 --> 01:24:10.570
Enjoy knowing the Lord.

243
01:24:12.570 --> 01:24:14.570
Learn to know Him.

244
01:24:18.570 --> 01:24:22.570
Do not rush ahead to do all sorts of things for God. You are not yet formed.

245
01:24:22.570 --> 01:24:32.570
Jesus goes at a set time, because He is about to start His ministry.

246
01:24:34.570 --> 01:24:36.570
And it is going to be an intensive ministry.

247
01:24:38.570 --> 01:24:40.570
Not everyone is happy with Jesus.

248
01:24:43.570 --> 01:24:45.570
Not everyone gives Him a pat on the back.

249
01:24:47.570 --> 01:24:49.570
He must live by the Spirit.

250
01:24:52.570 --> 01:25:00.570
He must live day in and day out for the love and approval of the Father, not of people.

251
01:25:03.570 --> 01:25:05.570
Some will receive Him.

252
01:25:06.570 --> 01:25:08.570
Many will reject Him.

253
01:25:09.570 --> 01:25:11.570
It is still the same today.

254
01:25:12.570 --> 01:25:14.570
Some receive the Son of Man.

255
01:25:16.570 --> 01:25:18.570
Many reject Him.

256
01:25:22.570 --> 01:25:28.570
He is preparing for that ministry, which culminates at the cross.

257
01:25:35.570 --> 01:25:37.570
And Satan brings three temptations to Jesus.

258
01:25:41.570 --> 01:25:43.570
And He fasts for forty days.

259
01:25:43.570 --> 01:25:48.570
And then Satan comes and first appeals to the physical hunger that Jesus has.

260
01:25:50.570 --> 01:25:51.570
For it is great hunger.

261
01:25:53.570 --> 01:25:55.570
How many of you know that your flesh is strong?

262
01:25:58.570 --> 01:26:00.570
Jesus even says it later in the Gospel.

263
01:26:02.570 --> 01:26:04.570
Jesus says that your flesh is strong.

264
01:26:07.570 --> 01:26:09.570
Jesus says that your flesh is strong.

265
01:26:09.570 --> 01:26:11.570
Jesus says that your flesh is strong.

266
01:26:21.570 --> 01:26:23.570
Jesus says that your spirit is willing, but your flesh is weak.

267
01:26:25.570 --> 01:26:27.570
Jesus says that your flesh is weak, but your flesh is weak.

268
01:26:31.570 --> 01:26:33.570
And we listen a lot to our flesh.

269
01:26:40.570 --> 01:26:44.570
And Satan comes and he appeals to that physical hunger that Jesus feels loud and clear.

270
01:26:49.570 --> 01:26:54.570
And Satan comes and he appeals to that physical hunger that Jesus feels loud and clear.

271
01:26:55.570 --> 01:26:57.570
And now we know that Jesus does not want it.

272
01:26:58.570 --> 01:27:00.570
Why would this make sense?

273
01:27:01.570 --> 01:27:03.570
He comes to him and he says...

274
01:27:04.570 --> 01:27:08.570
Hey Jesus, why don't you come and turn these stones into bread?

275
01:27:14.570 --> 01:27:17.570
And this would make sense on a number of levels.

276
01:27:18.570 --> 01:27:22.570
It would be that he uses his power for his own benefit.

277
01:27:24.570 --> 01:27:26.570
But Jesus did not use his power for his own gain.

278
01:27:29.570 --> 01:27:31.570
But Jesus did not use his power for his own gain.

279
01:27:34.570 --> 01:27:36.570
But Jesus did not use his power for his own gain.

280
01:27:46.570 --> 01:27:52.570
If he had given in at that moment, then he would have already sinned and his entire ministry would have been powerless.

281
01:27:54.570 --> 01:27:58.570
And then Satan comes and he says, Jesus is hungry, I will go to his physical ministry.

282
01:27:59.570 --> 01:28:02.570
Hey, come and turn these stones into bread. You are the son of a man, you have all power and authority.

283
01:28:03.570 --> 01:28:04.570
Satan knows it.

284
01:28:05.570 --> 01:28:07.570
Satan knows exactly who the son of a man is.

285
01:28:08.570 --> 01:28:09.570
He has all power and authority.

286
01:28:10.570 --> 01:28:11.570
So why not just, no one knows it.

287
01:28:12.570 --> 01:28:14.570
We are alone, we are nearby.

288
01:28:15.570 --> 01:28:16.570
No one knows Jesus.

289
01:28:17.570 --> 01:28:18.570
Just do it.

290
01:28:19.570 --> 01:28:22.570
And Satan comes to Jesus and Satan knows very well who Jesus is.

291
01:28:23.570 --> 01:28:29.570
And he says, if you are the Son of God, command these stones to turn into bread.

292
01:28:30.570 --> 01:28:31.570
No one who knows it.

293
01:28:33.570 --> 01:28:35.570
And in verse 4, Jesus answers.

294
01:28:36.570 --> 01:28:37.570
It is written.

295
01:28:44.570 --> 01:28:45.570
Man shall not live by bread alone.

296
01:28:45.570 --> 01:28:47.570
But by every word that comes from the mouth of God.

297
01:28:54.570 --> 01:28:55.570
How many times have you heard that already?

298
01:28:57.570 --> 01:28:58.570
Do you understand it?

299
01:29:03.570 --> 01:29:04.570
I think we do not understand that yet.

300
01:29:09.570 --> 01:29:12.570
I think we know it in the sense of, yes, I know that it says that.

301
01:29:13.570 --> 01:29:15.570
But I don't think we understand what that practically means.

302
01:29:28.570 --> 01:29:36.570
Jesus explains here that sons and daughters of God are not satisfied, are not fulfilled by bread alone.

303
01:29:43.570 --> 01:29:48.570
The sons and daughters of God find no satisfaction in eating and drinking.

304
01:29:53.570 --> 01:29:57.570
The sons and daughters of God hunger for righteousness.

305
01:30:01.570 --> 01:30:05.570
If you are physically hungry, then you feel pain.

306
01:30:09.570 --> 01:30:11.570
And hunger is a driving force.

307
01:30:12.570 --> 01:30:15.570
So you, I know you, I don't know you, but I know you.

308
01:30:15.570 --> 01:30:19.570
When you get hungry, you immediately start looking for something.

309
01:30:23.570 --> 01:30:25.570
Yes, you do. Yes, I do that too.

310
01:30:25.570 --> 01:30:30.570
When I am hungry, that hunger drives me to get something.

311
01:30:34.570 --> 01:30:35.570
Hunger is powerful.

312
01:30:37.570 --> 01:30:39.570
It is a driving force in your life.

313
01:30:40.570 --> 01:30:44.570
And that hunger in the natural is not enough for you.

314
01:30:48.570 --> 01:30:50.570
I am here for something great.

315
01:30:52.570 --> 01:30:54.570
I will not break my fast.

316
01:30:58.570 --> 01:30:59.570
Because that is sin.

317
01:31:02.570 --> 01:31:04.570
I live for righteousness.

318
01:31:04.570 --> 01:31:06.570
I live for righteousness.

319
01:31:08.570 --> 01:31:10.570
I want to do the will of the Father.

320
01:31:13.570 --> 01:31:15.570
There is something deeper going on.

321
01:31:19.570 --> 01:31:25.570
We as sons and daughters of God, we do not live only for the pleasure of eating and drinking.

322
01:31:26.570 --> 01:31:31.570
We are sons and daughters of God, we do not live merely for the pleasure of eating and drinking.

323
01:31:34.570 --> 01:31:39.570
We hunger for the will of God to be fully done on earth.

324
01:31:47.570 --> 01:31:51.570
And as people, we live by every word that God speaks.

325
01:31:56.570 --> 01:32:00.570
Life does not come from eating and drinking, it comes from the Word of God.

326
01:32:05.570 --> 01:32:09.570
But here is the test, when we see that we are spiritually lacking.

327
01:32:17.570 --> 01:32:24.570
Are we then just as quick to cry out to God and do we turn to His Word and cry out to His Spirit?

328
01:32:26.570 --> 01:32:29.570
When we see that we are spiritually bankrupt.

329
01:32:36.570 --> 01:32:42.570
Do we then use that to turn to the Word and take it in as life itself?

330
01:32:43.570 --> 01:32:45.570
That is what Jesus is saying here.

331
01:32:49.570 --> 01:32:52.570
He says, the Word of God is a higher priority.

332
01:32:55.570 --> 01:32:57.570
There is a deeper satisfaction in it.

333
01:33:04.570 --> 01:33:06.570
And I do not know if we really believe that.

334
01:33:10.570 --> 01:33:11.570
In reality.

335
01:33:18.570 --> 01:33:23.570
And that is something we may learn, that is what it is about. We learn to walk in that righteousness.

336
01:33:25.570 --> 01:33:37.570
And as we then give our lives in that way, we gradually find out that He was right.

337
01:33:43.570 --> 01:33:50.570
Then we discover that it indeed gives more satisfaction to do the will of God and to be in His Word.

338
01:33:56.570 --> 01:34:05.570
There is a higher source of nourishment for the sons and daughters of God, and that is us.

339
01:34:05.570 --> 01:34:12.570
So the Lord says, I want you to thrive. I want you to live. We do not live only on food and drink.

340
01:34:12.570 --> 01:34:20.570
He says, you will live, you will truly live as you hold onto every word of God.

341
01:34:28.570 --> 01:34:30.570
We need to fast more.

342
01:34:31.570 --> 01:34:33.570
We need more.

343
01:34:34.570 --> 01:34:44.570
For everything is an opponent until you do it. It does not come to life, we must learn the way of the Lord in the kingdom.

344
01:34:50.570 --> 01:34:52.570
Hunger is a driving force.

345
01:34:52.570 --> 01:34:54.570
Hunger is a driving force.

346
01:34:57.570 --> 01:35:00.570
It makes you chase something.

347
01:35:10.570 --> 01:35:17.570
At that moment, Jesus was not looking for a quick satisfaction of bread. He says, I come to do the will of my Father.

348
01:35:22.570 --> 01:35:31.570
The whole culture in which we live believes that we need food and drink for our lives.

349
01:35:36.570 --> 01:35:42.570
If I have enough to eat and drink and I am satisfied, then I live the good life.

350
01:35:43.570 --> 01:35:47.570
And Jesus said, actually not.

351
01:35:50.570 --> 01:35:52.570
There is something deeper in you that cries out.

352
01:35:54.570 --> 01:35:56.570
But you are not even close to that yet.

353
01:36:01.570 --> 01:36:04.570
You do not feel it yet because you are numbed by everything around you.

354
01:36:08.570 --> 01:36:11.570
Fasting brings that spirit forward.

355
01:36:13.570 --> 01:36:20.570
Fasting articulates the physical, for a season, a short time. It does not have to be so long.

356
01:36:21.570 --> 01:36:26.570
But it articulates that flesh and puts the spirit first.

357
01:36:27.570 --> 01:36:29.570
Priority and stronger than the flesh.

358
01:36:30.570 --> 01:36:31.570
You can do it.

359
01:36:38.570 --> 01:36:39.570
You can do it.

360
01:36:39.570 --> 01:36:40.570
And you can.

361
01:36:41.570 --> 01:36:42.570
For Jesus did it.

362
01:36:44.570 --> 01:36:46.570
And He has given His spirit to you.

363
01:36:58.570 --> 01:37:04.570
His sons and daughters will also do this and they will fulfill the will of the Father.

364
01:37:09.570 --> 01:37:12.570
And in Matthew 5, Jesus gives His brilliant Sermon on the Mount.

365
01:37:16.570 --> 01:37:20.570
And it is brilliant because He tells you here how He lives.

366
01:37:25.570 --> 01:37:26.570
He lived this life.

367
01:37:33.570 --> 01:37:38.570
In Matthew 5 verse 6 it says, blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness.

368
01:37:40.570 --> 01:37:42.570
For they shall be satisfied.

369
01:37:43.570 --> 01:37:44.570
It is not a metaphor.

370
01:37:45.570 --> 01:37:47.570
It is not figurative language or a symbol.

371
01:37:48.570 --> 01:37:50.570
Blessed are the poor in spirit.

372
01:37:51.570 --> 01:37:52.570
We always think it is the poor in Africa.

373
01:37:53.570 --> 01:37:54.570
No, no, no.

374
01:37:54.570 --> 01:37:55.570
He says the poor in spirit.

375
01:37:55.570 --> 01:37:57.570
If you know that you need God, you are blessed.

376
01:37:59.570 --> 01:38:03.570
If you think you are good, then you must fall into the poor.

377
01:38:04.570 --> 01:38:05.570
I have nothing.

378
01:38:05.570 --> 01:38:06.570
Spiritually I need the Lord.

379
01:38:17.570 --> 01:38:21.570
Because it is so important that you know about yourself that you need Him.

380
01:38:37.570 --> 01:38:39.570
This is the middle of the eight beatitudes.

381
01:38:39.570 --> 01:38:43.570
And those eight beatitudes are the call of the heart of the kingdom.

382
01:38:43.570 --> 01:38:46.570
Who cries out for righteousness here on earth?

383
01:38:47.570 --> 01:38:52.570
Who seeks Him and His righteousness first?

384
01:38:53.570 --> 01:38:57.570
Instead of our own gain.

385
01:38:58.570 --> 01:39:03.570
He says to people, this is the way to live.

386
01:39:04.570 --> 01:39:05.570
Blessed are you.

387
01:39:06.570 --> 01:39:08.570
And that does not mean happy.

388
01:39:08.570 --> 01:39:11.570
It means that you are blessed.

389
01:39:11.570 --> 01:39:19.570
You are in a completeness that this earthly culture cannot bring you.

390
01:39:28.570 --> 01:39:30.570
We do not believe it until we do it.

391
01:39:30.570 --> 01:39:32.570
For when you do it, you begin to believe.

392
01:39:32.570 --> 01:39:34.570
It feeds your faith.

393
01:39:34.570 --> 01:39:36.570
Oh yes, okay.

394
01:39:36.570 --> 01:39:38.570
I see it more and more.

395
01:39:38.570 --> 01:39:44.570
It is as if we practice what He gave us, so that these realities become real.

396
01:39:53.570 --> 01:39:57.570
This is a deep friendship with the Son of Man.

397
01:39:57.570 --> 01:40:02.570
This is a deep friendship with the Son of Man.

398
01:40:04.570 --> 01:40:07.570
It is to desire what He desires.

399
01:40:08.570 --> 01:40:10.570
And to do His will.

400
01:40:10.570 --> 01:40:12.570
While we are here on earth.

401
01:40:17.570 --> 01:40:21.570
There is something that gives more satisfaction than food.

402
01:40:22.570 --> 01:40:25.570
And we may enjoy feasting.

403
01:40:25.570 --> 01:40:27.570
That is not what it is about.

404
01:40:29.570 --> 01:40:33.570
But my whole life cannot revolve around eating and drinking.

405
01:40:35.570 --> 01:40:39.570
I must be hungry for that righteousness.

406
01:40:40.570 --> 01:40:43.570
We must be hungry for the will of God.

407
01:40:43.570 --> 01:40:47.570
In my life, in my family, in my church, in my country.

408
01:40:50.570 --> 01:40:57.570
We must be hungry for the will of God in my life, in my family, in my church, in my country.

409
01:41:03.570 --> 01:41:07.570
In John 4, it is not specifically about fasting, but He does say it again there.

410
01:41:10.570 --> 01:41:16.570
Jesus is on a mission and He is sitting by a well.

411
01:41:16.570 --> 01:41:18.570
He met a Samaritan woman there.

412
01:41:22.570 --> 01:41:27.570
The disciples were with Him, but they have already gone into the city to arrange lunch.

413
01:41:29.570 --> 01:41:33.570
Jesus is in His ministry and He is still busy.

414
01:41:35.570 --> 01:41:38.570
Jesus only did what He saw the Father doing.

415
01:41:40.570 --> 01:41:46.570
Jesus was sent by the Father to meet that Samaritan woman at the well.

416
01:41:52.570 --> 01:41:55.570
It is a long passage, so we will not read it all.

417
01:41:59.570 --> 01:42:01.570
He begins to speak to her.

418
01:42:04.570 --> 01:42:07.570
She needs Him, but she does not know it yet.

419
01:42:10.570 --> 01:42:14.570
She has had about four or five husbands and now she has landed with number six.

420
01:42:19.570 --> 01:42:23.570
Jesus lays her life before her and she says,

421
01:42:23.570 --> 01:42:26.570
the one you are with now is also your spouse now.

422
01:42:27.570 --> 01:42:28.570
He knows everything.

423
01:42:29.570 --> 01:42:30.570
He knows everything.

424
01:42:30.570 --> 01:42:35.570
That is why she says, there is that man who told me everything about my life.

425
01:42:43.570 --> 01:42:46.570
And he asks her, may I have some water?

426
01:42:48.570 --> 01:42:50.570
And she says, I cannot give you any water.

427
01:42:55.570 --> 01:42:59.570
You are a Jew, I am a Samaritan, it is not even okay for us to talk together now.

428
01:43:00.570 --> 01:43:01.570
That is strange.

429
01:43:07.570 --> 01:43:12.570
And Jesus answered her, everyone who drinks this water will be thirsty again.

430
01:43:15.570 --> 01:43:17.570
