451
01:44:49.570 --> 01:44:50.570
I am a village woman.

452
01:44:51.570 --> 01:44:52.570
I am weary from the culture.

453
01:44:59.570 --> 01:45:02.570
It would really help me if you would give me some water.

454
01:45:05.570 --> 01:45:06.570
